# Source photographs and brand artwork.
# These are kept in the repository as originals, but nothing on the site
# references them - the browser only loads assets/img/* and assets/fonts/*.
# Excluding them keeps ~20MB of unreferenced files (including HEIC originals
# that carry camera metadata) off the public CDN.
assets/*.HEIC
assets/*.JPG
assets/*.jpg
assets/slide*.svg
assets/logo*.png
assets/README.md
assets/.DS_Store
.DS_Store
demo-*.png
.vscode
.idea
